  "duration_s": 290.850998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "今天有个业务要和供应商那边对接，我有别的事情要忙，你俩就替我去一趟吧。好的，王姐保证完成任务哦。对了，供应商那边的陈姐可是个厉害角色，别被人家拿捏了哦，师傅，能不能快点啊，我们有急事儿，哎呀，慢点安全不差。这一会儿师傅麻烦快点儿，我早上吃坏了东西，感觉要憋不住了。哎呦，小姑娘，你忍住哈，马上就到了，马上到人家这里拜访也不能空着手吧，走咱们看看去买点礼物。好的，我觉得也是听说这个陈姐爱打羽毛球，那这个球拍正合适，一千多块够档次。那我买盒羽毛球吧，也是一千多。陈姐肯定喜欢我这个高档球拍，羽毛球买这么贵的，干啥不都一个样吗？要感谢两位百忙之中来我们这儿，欢迎欢迎。陈姐，您真客气，这不我听说您爱打羽毛球，特意给您挑了个好球拍，破费了。陈姐，这是我给您买的羽毛球，听说是手工制作的，我也不懂，您凑合用吧。哎呦，这球手该可棒了。小姑娘这么远过来，饿了吧，走走走包间，我都订好了，咱们边吃边聊。感谢陈姐和大家的宴请。这俗话说得好，酒杯一拿，事业发达，酒杯一抬，升官发财，酒杯一举鹏程万里。酒杯一碰，财源滚滚，酒杯一响，黄金万两酒杯一干业绩翻番。来，我们一起举杯。那个哈哈哈陈姐，我敬你一杯，你凭什么敬我这一杯？陈姐，我们不图升官，也不图财，究竟您愿意看得起我们这些晚辈，很多东西花钱都买不到，但您几句话就能把我们点透，真的得记一辈子。好好这话，我爱听来干了。琳琳。今天这桌菜合不合你胃口啊，饭菜是填饱肚子的，您讲的话才是充实脑子的。今天这顿饭不重要，能坐在这儿，听您说话才是真的赚大了。听听都听听这姑娘会说话，谁学声狗叫，我就给谁一千块钱。祝陈姐家庭旺，事业旺以后，日子旺上加旺，一共四升四千块。这酒开了，怎么不先给我倒，先倒的是客，后倒的是主。您是今天的主人，最后一杯满上代表压肘，全桌的福气都沉淀在您这杯里啊。哈哈哈说的好，这杯我干了让你跑这么远，送我耽误你俩工作了吧，不耽误在办公室忙一天是把事儿做完，路上听您聊半个小时，是学怎么把事儿做好，这哪是耽误啊，这是赚了。今天咱们两家公司谈的很开心，下批材料我给你们价格再低十个点儿，太感谢了。陈姐，您慢走琳琳，你太厉害了。今天这陈杰可太难对付了没你我肯定完蛋。你这嘴皮子是咋练的呀？我总是嘴笨，反应慢一点，都不会说。我父母从小就让我看这本把话说的恰到好处。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起呀，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下无弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我异解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，还有配套书籍，把事做的恰到好处，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这套书真的可以帮助到你好的。林姐，我这就回去看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 2430,
      "text": "今天有个业务要和供应商那边对接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2810,
      "end_ms": 3890,
      "text": "我有别的事情要忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4510,
      "end_ms": 5830,
      "text": "你俩就替我去一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6270,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6610,
      "end_ms": 8650,
      "text": "王姐保证完成任务哦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8650,
      "end_ms": 9050,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9830,
      "end_ms": 11790,
      "text": "供应商那边的陈姐可是个厉害角色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12110,
      "end_ms": 13405,
      "text": "别被人家拿捏了哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16820,
      "end_ms": 17140,
      "text": "师傅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17140,
      "end_ms": 17900,
      "text": "能不能快点啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17900,
      "end_ms": 18840,
      "text": "我们有急事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19080,
      "end_ms": 19560,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19580,
      "end_ms": 20920,
      "text": "慢点安全不差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20920,
      "end_ms": 26820,
      "text": "这一会儿师傅麻烦快点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26820,
      "end_ms": 28400,
      "text": "我早上吃坏了东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28400,
      "end_ms": 29480,
      "text": "感觉要憋不住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29900,
      "end_ms": 30200,
      "text": "哎呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 30720,
      "text": "小姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 30860,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "你忍住哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 31660,
      "end_ms": 32320,
      "text": "马上就到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 32320,
      "end_ms": 41200,
      "text": "马上到人家这里拜访也不能空着手吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41340,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "text": "走咱们看看去买点礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43320,
      "end_ms": 43760,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43960,
      "end_ms": 46919,
      "text": "我觉得也是听说这个陈姐爱打羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47580,
      "end_ms": 48700,
      "text": "那这个球拍正合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48920,
      "end_ms": 50075,
      "text": "一千多块够档次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52180,
      "end_ms": 53460,
      "text": "那我买盒羽毛球吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 53540,
      "end_ms": 54340,
      "text": "也是一千多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54680,
      "end_ms": 57260,
      "text": "陈姐肯定喜欢我这个高档球拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57580,
      "end_ms": 58680,
      "text": "羽毛球买这么贵的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58680,
      "end_ms": 60085,
      "text": "干啥不都一个样吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 60330,
      "end_ms": 63685,
      "text": "要感谢两位百忙之中来我们这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 64150,
      "end_ms": 65035,
      "text": "欢迎欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 65610,
      "end_ms": 65970,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65970,
      "end_ms": 66585,
      "text": "您真客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66770,
      "end_ms": 68590,
      "text": "这不我听说您爱打羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68810,
      "end_ms": 70375,
      "text": "特意给您挑了个好球拍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74140,
      "end_ms": 74945,
      "text": "破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 75270,
      "end_ms": 75715,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 76000,
      "end_ms": 77340,
      "text": "这是我给您买的羽毛球，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77640,
      "end_ms": 79020,
      "text": "听说是手工制作的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79020,
      "end_ms": 79580,
      "text": "我也不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 79600,
      "end_ms": 80445,
      "text": "您凑合用吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 81920,
      "end_ms": 82380,
      "text": "哎呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 82920,
      "end_ms": 84285,
      "text": "这球手该可棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 84790,
      "end_ms": 85830,
      "text": "小姑娘这么远过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 85830,
      "end_ms": 86350,
      "text": "饿了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 86490,
      "end_ms": 87470,
      "text": "走走走包间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 87470,
      "end_ms": 87990,
      "text": "我都订好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87990,
      "end_ms": 88915,
      "text": "咱们边吃边聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 90320,
      "end_ms": 92175,
      "text": "感谢陈姐和大家的宴请。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 92760,
      "end_ms": 93840,
      "text": "这俗话说得好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 94080,
      "end_ms": 94840,
      "text": "酒杯一拿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95020,
      "end_ms": 95740,
      "text": "事业发达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 95960,
      "end_ms": 96620,
      "text": "酒杯一抬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 96780,
      "end_ms": 97520,
      "text": "升官发财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 97760,
      "end_ms": 99475,
      "text": "酒杯一举鹏程万里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 99790,
      "end_ms": 100485,
      "text": "酒杯一碰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 100780,
      "end_ms": 101520,
      "text": "财源滚滚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 101660,
      "end_ms": 102340,
      "text": "酒杯一响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 102500,
      "end_ms": 105175,
      "text": "黄金万两酒杯一干业绩翻番。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 105820,
      "end_ms": 106060,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 106200,
      "end_ms": 107165,
      "text": "我们一起举杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 107810,
      "end_ms": 114225,
      "text": "那个哈哈哈陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 114550,
      "end_ms": 115295,
      "text": "我敬你一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 116240,
      "end_ms": 117635,
      "text": "你凭什么敬我这一杯？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 120470,
      "end_ms": 120970,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 121550,
      "end_ms": 122570,
      "text": "我们不图升官，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 122650,
      "end_ms": 123290,
      "text": "也不图财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 123790,
      "end_ms": 126030,
      "text": "究竟您愿意看得起我们这些晚辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126450,
      "end_ms": 128290,
      "text": "很多东西花钱都买不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 128590,
      "end_ms": 130450,
      "text": "但您几句话就能把我们点透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 130990,
      "end_ms": 132170,
      "text": "真的得记一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 133730,
      "end_ms": 135170,
      "text": "好好这话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 135170,
      "end_ms": 136515,
      "text": "我爱听来干了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 138610,
      "end_ms": 139030,
      "text": "琳琳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 139610,
      "end_ms": 141470,
      "text": "今天这桌菜合不合你胃口啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 141530,
      "end_ms": 143030,
      "text": "饭菜是填饱肚子的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 143090,
      "end_ms": 144870,
      "text": "您讲的话才是充实脑子的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 145130,
      "end_ms": 146490,
      "text": "今天这顿饭不重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 146710,
      "end_ms": 147350,
      "text": "能坐在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 147350,
      "end_ms": 149350,
      "text": "听您说话才是真的赚大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 150190,
      "end_ms": 152570,
      "text": "听听都听听这姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 153630,
      "end_ms": 154610,
      "text": "谁学声狗叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 154950,
      "end_ms": 156405,
      "text": "我就给谁一千块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 160670,
      "end_ms": 161690,
      "text": "祝陈姐家庭旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 161690,
      "end_ms": 162390,
      "text": "事业旺以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 162390,
      "end_ms": 163390,
      "text": "日子旺上加旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 163410,
      "end_ms": 165435,
      "text": "一共四升四千块。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 173720,
      "end_ms": 174200,
      "text": "这酒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 174200,
      "end_ms": 175100,
      "text": "怎么不先给我倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 176640,
      "end_ms": 177480,
      "text": "先倒的是客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 177680,
      "end_ms": 178560,
      "text": "后倒的是主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 178900,
      "end_ms": 179980,
      "text": "您是今天的主人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 180220,
      "end_ms": 181780,
      "text": "最后一杯满上代表压肘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 181920,
      "end_ms": 184375,
      "text": "全桌的福气都沉淀在您这杯里啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 184600,
      "end_ms": 186310,
      "text": "哈哈哈说的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 186690,
      "end_ms": 189350,
      "text": "这杯我干了让你跑这么远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 189350,
      "end_ms": 192665,
      "text": "送我耽误你俩工作了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 193000,
      "end_ms": 196495,
      "text": "不耽误在办公室忙一天是把事儿做完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 197050,
      "end_ms": 198550,
      "text": "路上听您聊半个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 198790,
      "end_ms": 200210,
      "text": "是学怎么把事儿做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 200630,
      "end_ms": 201690,
      "text": "这哪是耽误啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 201750,
      "end_ms": 202855,
      "text": "这是赚了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 203710,
      "end_ms": 205690,
      "text": "今天咱们两家公司谈的很开心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 205930,
      "end_ms": 208470,
      "text": "下批材料我给你们价格再低十个点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 208870,
      "end_ms": 209535,
      "text": "太感谢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 209720,
      "end_ms": 210160,
      "text": "陈姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 210160,
      "end_ms": 213055,
      "text": "您慢走琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 213350,
      "end_ms": 214235,
      "text": "你太厉害了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 214500,
      "end_ms": 217445,
      "text": "今天这陈杰可太难对付了没你我肯定完蛋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 217980,
      "end_ms": 219575,
      "text": "你这嘴皮子是咋练的呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 220220,
      "end_ms": 221000,
      "text": "我总是嘴笨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 221020,
      "end_ms": 221940,
      "text": "反应慢一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 221940,
      "end_ms": 222615,
      "text": "都不会说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 223870,
      "end_ms": 227465,
      "text": "我父母从小就让我看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 227770,
      "end_ms": 228870,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 228890,
      "end_ms": 229570,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 229570,
      "end_ms": 230390,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 230530,
      "end_ms": 234525,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交推荐你读完这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 234780,
      "end_ms": 236825,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 237250,
      "end_ms": 238415,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 238670,
      "end_ms": 240010,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 240210,
      "end_ms": 242634,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 242880,
      "end_ms": 244020,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 244040,
      "end_ms": 244955,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 245290,
      "end_ms": 245450,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 245450,
      "end_ms": 247090,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 247210,
      "end_ms": 247905,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 248270,
      "end_ms": 249470,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 249470,
      "end_ms": 250735,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 251380,
      "end_ms": 252655,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 252860,
      "end_ms": 254580,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 254680,
      "end_ms": 255580,
      "text": "和你在一起呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 255620,
      "end_ms": 258180,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 258180,
      "end_ms": 259495,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 259710,
      "end_ms": 260815,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 261060,
      "end_ms": 262340,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 262420,
      "end_ms": 263705,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00140",
      "start_ms": 264130,
      "end_ms": 265210,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00141",
      "start_ms": 265210,
      "end_ms": 267205,
      "text": "这个真是让我异解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00142",
      "start_ms": 267440,
      "end_ms": 268615,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00143",
      "start_ms": 268870,
      "end_ms": 271270,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00144",
      "start_ms": 271270,
      "end_ms": 272055,
      "text": "应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00145",
      "start_ms": 272400,
      "end_ms": 274980,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00146",
      "start_ms": 274980,
      "end_ms": 276100,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00147",
      "start_ms": 276320,
      "end_ms": 277720,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00148",
      "start_ms": 277720,
      "end_ms": 279645,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00149",
      "start_ms": 279970,
      "end_ms": 281010,
      "text": "还有配套书籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00150",
      "start_ms": 281150,
      "end_ms": 282490,
      "text": "把事做的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00151",
      "start_ms": 283010,
      "end_ms": 284210,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00152",
      "start_ms": 284270,
      "end_ms": 286375,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00153",
      "start_ms": 286790,
      "end_ms": 289150,
      "text": "这套书真的可以帮助到你好的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00154",
      "start_ms": 289150,
      "end_ms": 289605,
      "text": "林姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b2bbecb4fc6ef0e9_s00155",
      "start_ms": 289910,
      "end_ms": 290685,
      "text": "我这就回去看。"
    }
  ],
